rop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3502a264c00d1f615ebf629ea436c8f, https://si.imgix.net/fc086698/uploads/origins/56d318aa-707d-458b-a2e0-55ebcbbd76a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a884706300d28b9ba94863086f37ccb2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fc086698/uploads/origins/56d318aa-707d-458b-a2e0-55ebcbbd76a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bbb7c382f47a20e3e124b189774cfba 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Concept art for my character Yasmina. She is a Toreador who is disputing control over Damascus red light district. Young and atractive, she is of slender build. Pale skin, grey eyes, red lips and wears her dark hair loose. She dresses in crimson, see through silks.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Grimmjow1903/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b966802554e47d25ad015d11b88ab622", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b966802554e47d25ad015d11b88ab622, https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91cf502de422010ffe228911f9acfcb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e001b85ba8560bfdb56acf8ef7b0722a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "A concept draiwng depicting Inashat, Mother of the Swarm, one of the bosses from my Vampire: Dark Ages campaign. She is a Baali priestess, right hand and childe of the Prince of Damascus. She is a middle-aged woman, her body swollen and misshapen, as if she were permanently pregnant with something… unnatural. Her black robes, stiff with dried blood, hang heavily over her deformed figure.\nHer face is almost completely hidden beneath a hood, but those who manage to glimpse it will see sickly, ash-colored skin and eyes shining with madness.\nA scarab brooch adorns her chest, similar to the one worn by Alharith/Abdiel.\nIdeally, she should be cutting open her \"pregnant\" belly with a dagger, letting a swarm of insects loose.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Grimmjow1903/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86218bab477335ec497fa64e8bb151e9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86218bab477335ec497fa64e8bb151e9, https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f3ba710fc439ba960fe398e96489755 2x, https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80f7aa2d0c9c53de28f97775325ce3d6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Grimm,\n\nI'm looking for a cute Halloween drawing of Mono Monet (https://x.com/mono_monet) with her tabemono in costumes. I think any costumes will work for both mono and tabemono. Feel free to draw what you like.\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Grimmjow1903/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7766bf35/uploads/origins/6c8ac5e9-3759-4806-aba5-c993aad74f1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a45c208e34aecd522536866fa8350f8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7766bf35/uploads/origins/6c8ac5e9-3759-4806-aba5-c993aad74f1f?bg=%23fff&auto=f